note dc_gib: "%.1f" of kB / 1048576.0, the kB count rounded to f64 first as (double) does.
fn dc_gib o edit uchar 786432 p ulong v ulong to ulong
t = new uchar 1600 0
n = fm_f div f64 v DCMB 1 t
for i ulong n
put o add p i get t i
end
ret add p n
end
